---
/**
 * US momentum terminal hero + command strip.
 * IDs stay stable for client render loop.
 */
---
<section class="terminal-hero card">
  <div class="hero-top">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">🇺🇸 US ETF TREND &amp; RISK TERMINAL · <span id="hero-pool-size">—</span> POOL</span>
      <h1>美股趋势风控雷达</h1>
      <p>两套策略共用的市场确认与风险过滤层；负责识别结构、强弱和过热，不直接构成买入指令。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <span id="model-date">模型日期 —</span>
      <span id="source-date">行情日期 —</span>
      <span>行情：🔴上涨 / 🟢下跌</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="command" role="status" aria-live="polite">
    <span class="command-icon" id="command-icon">◉</span>
    <div>
      <span>TREND COMMAND</span>
      <strong id="command-title">正在载入趋势结论</strong>
      <p id="command-text">计算ETF池趋势结构、扩散度与风险约束…</p>
      <button id="retry-load" type="button" hidden>重试加载</button>
    </div>
    <a class="macro-chip" href="/us-macro/">
      <small>宏观约束</small>
      <b id="macro-status">读取中 →</b>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
